  "story": {
    "title": "The Good Cook",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Once upon a time, there lived a cook called Jenny, But all her family and friends did not like the food that she made.",
      "So her dad and mum told her to practice more and remember that 'Practice makes perfect'. So she did.",
      "On Monday, she cooked some soup. It tasted super horrible. On Tuesday, she cooked some soup again. It tasted yucky. On Wednesday, she cooked some soup again. It tasted a little yucky.",
      "On Thursday, she cooked some soup again. It tasted a little delicious. On Friday, she cooked some soup again. It tasted super delicious!",
      "Jenny became a good cook. Now she understood why her parents told her to remember 'Practice makes perfect'!"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Once upon a time, there lived a cook called Jenny, But all her family and friends did not like the food that she made.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngày xửa ngày xưa, có một cô đầu bếp tên là Jenny. Thế nhưng, tất cả gia đình và bạn bè đều không thích món ăn cô nấu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So her dad and mum told her to practice more and remember that 'Practice makes perfect'.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thế là bố và mẹ cô ấy bảo cô tập luyện nhiều hơn và nhớ rằng 'Có công mài sắt, có ngày nên kim'."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So she did.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thế là cô ấy đã làm theo."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "On Monday, she cooked some soup.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vào thứ Hai, cô ấy nấu món súp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It tasted super horrible.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó dở tệ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "On Tuesday, she cooked some soup again.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vào thứ Ba, cô ấy lại nấu súp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It tasted yucky.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có vị dở ẹc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "On Wednesday, she cooked some soup again.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vào thứ Tư, cô ấy lại nấu súp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It tasted a little yucky.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có vị hơi dở ẹc."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "On Thursday, she cooked some soup again.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vào thứ Năm, cô ấy lại nấu súp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It tasted a little delicious.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có vị hơi ngon."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "On Friday, she cooked some soup again.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vào thứ Sáu, cô ấy lại nấu súp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It tasted super delicious!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có vị siêu ngon!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Jenny became a good cook.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Jenny đã trở thành một đầu bếp giỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Now she understood why her parents told her to remember 'Practice makes perfect'!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_118317/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ cô ấy đã hiểu vì sao bố mẹ bảo cô nhớ câu 'Có công mài sắt, có ngày nên kim'!"
      }
    ]
  },
